{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very simple city builder game with the main purpose of scaling up your population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place build orders for your citizens to build new homes, plant food or plant new trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more citizens you have the faster the city can grow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For me as the developer of this game, the purpose was to try to write efficient code to see how much a PC can handle before it begins to slow down. So try out and see how many citizens your device can handle.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/339fc34321e45fe10fb1fbc6a14faf76ff7c8714.jpg"},{"name":"India","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/ae90cda81d791bae3dd0bfdaef42452eef374b3c.jpg"},{"name":"China","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/ddc0c3be8b399075d7ac46f2d0792fc5193e3a03.jpg"},{"name":"United States","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/40ca7823e52d36ede01d5d38a4995fea5a961714.jpg"},{"name":"Indonesia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/01b525aaa26f2cd5b56ca5dff8e992b5a4610a44.jpg"},{"name":"Pakistan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/955343160a930a4c3c3a601973f3b9ed28e53234.jpg"},{"name":"Nigeria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/669b1569bd03c5d7136294d7c0f39b31b0562840.jpg"},{"name":"Brazil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/2a3816460d31f61d1160121dd2a09ed3234c2391.jpg"},{"name":"Bangladesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820960/767e099d2b8dac1c64375ba8d1a6a5c799d35859.jpg"},{"name":"Ru